<translation id="5494571279964989269">{NUM_EXTENSIONS,plural, =1{I-João Browser incoma ukuthi usisuse}one{I-João Browser incoma ukuthi uzisuse}other{I-João Browser incoma ukuthi uzisuse}}</translation>
<translation id="2269053214123323740">Ukuze wabelane ngomsindo wohlelo, vula Amasethingi Ohlelo bese uvumela okuthi 'Ukurekhodwa Komsindo Wohlelo Kuphela' kuJoão Browser. Ngemva kwalokho kuzodingeka uqale kabusha iJoão Browser.</translation>
<translation id="731795002583552498">Ibuyekeza i-Chromium</translation>
<translation id="9065168747010082551">Ifayela lakho lokuncamelayo limoshakele noma alivumelekile.

I-João Browser ayikwazi ukubuyisela izilungiselelo zakho.</translation>
<translation id="7324051657739063017">Ungavula kabusha Imisebenzi Engokomongo ukuze ubuze imibuzo ngesikhathi ubhrawuza</translation>
<translation id="4159250197688136733">Iwebhu yakho, amabhukhimakhi, nezinye izinto ze-João Browser zihlala lapha.</translation>
<translation id="7347827960336370838">Ngumuntu onomushwana wakho wokungena kuphela ongafunda idatha yakho ebetheliwe. Umshwana wokungena awuthunyelwa noma ulondolozwe yiGoogle. Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />susa idatha yeChromium ku-akhawunti yakho<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="1062903713270840396">Umlawuli wakho wesistimu ulungiselele i-João Browser ukuthi ivule i-<ph name="ALTERNATIVE_BROWSER_NAME" /> ukuze ifinyelele ku-<ph name="TARGET_URL_HOSTNAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="7352651011704765696">Okuthile akuhambanga kahle</translation>
<translation id="5817362738974335084">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo ezizayo zeJoão Browser, uzodinga imacOS 13 noma eyakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa imacOS 12.</translation>
<translation id="7376384068949534168">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IChromium isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" /></translation>
<translation id="73786666777299047">Vula isitolo sewebhu se-Chrome</translation>
<translation id="5724625487458697703">Bonisa iGemini kuJoão Browser kugqoko lwesistimu</translation>
