<translation id="7450541714075000668">Umbhalo okopishiwe</translation>
<translation id="7458892263350425044">Ukuze usebenzise imakrofoni yakho, nikeza iChromium ukufinyelela <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />amasethingi ohlelo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="5422859338435319909">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-João Browser, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 7.</translation>
<translation id="7467949745582939695">Qalisa kabusha i-Chromium?</translation>
<translation id="7707324976708178089">Ayikwazi ukufaka inguqulo ye-João Browser efana nale esebenzayo okwamanje. Sicela uvale i-João Browser uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="7510190804000607802">Isikhumbuzi: Okungcono kakhulu kweGoogle ephaketheni lakho</translation>
<translation id="751935028865900641">Amasayithi cishe azosebenza njengokulindelwe. Uzophuma ngemvume kumasayithi amaningi uma uvala wonke amawindi e-Chromium, ngaphandle kwe-Google Account yakho uma ungene ngemvume ku-Chromium.</translation>
<translation id="5325102834460669866">{0,plural, =1{I-João Browser izoqalisa kabusha kuminithi elingu-1}one{I-João Browser izoqalisa kabusha emaminithini angu-#}other{I-João Browser izoqalisa kabusha emaminithini angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="7565444033145385702">Ukuvikela idatha lakho vumela iChromium isuse izimvume emasayithini ongakawavakasheli muva nje.</translation>
<translation id="8099958128052689767">Qalisa iJoão Browser ngokuzenzekelayo ukuze uqale ukubhrawuza ngokushesha.</translation>
<translation id="7583399374488819119">Isifaki Se-<ph name="COMPANY_NAME" /></translation>
<translation id="7125257608567714221">I-João Browser isebenzisa ikhamela yakho nemakrofoni.</translation>
<translation id="227045421902171569">I-João Browser ibe ngcono nakakhulu</translation>
<translation id="5356567285381070312">Manje unezakhi eziningi ezitholakala kuJoão Browser</translation>
<translation id="7624307931717240213">Sisebenzisa ulwazi ukuthuthukisa le sevisi. Bheka Inqubomgomo Yobumfihlo kanye Nemigomo Yesevisi.</translation>
<translation id="7649070708921625228">Usizo</translation>
<translation id="5714374331629713291">Thola i-App yeJoão Browser</translation>
<translation id="7658239707568436148">Khansela</translation>
<translation id="549378870470819535">I-João Browser akusona isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="6574348346278803862">Vumelanisa uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-João Browser kumadivayisi akho wonkana</translation>
<translation id="7699779824407626136">Isibuyekezo se-Chromium</translation>
<translation id="3304080024230377341">Umsebenzi wakho uvikelekile kuJoão Browser</translation>
<translation id="7716950018788545737">Imisebenzi iqediwe.</translation>
<translation id="77283119132245232">Inikeza amasevisi okulandelela isistimu ku-<ph name="BROWSER_NAME" />. Uma le sevisi ikhutshaziwe, ukusebenza kokulandelela okusungulwe yibhrawuza ngeke kuhlanganise imisebenzi yobubanzi besistimu njengokushintshwa kokuqukethwe kanye nemisebenzi esikulungele yochungechunge.</translation>
<translation id="7745317241717453663">Lokhu kuzosusa idatha yakho yokuphequlula kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-Chromium njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="7747138024166251722">Isifaki asikwazanga ukudala umkhombandlela wesikhashana. Sicela uhlolele isikhala esikhululekile sediski nemvume ukuze ufake isofthiwe.</translation>
<translation id="4713120944298974980">Sesha ku-João Browser</translation>
<translation id="5804390944809171853">Setha Kabusha kuJoão Browser Ezenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="6930487390575519812">Ukuze uvikele umsebenzi wakho kuJoão Browser, inhlangano yakho izokwazi ukubuka noma ukulawula ulwazi oluthile uma ungene ngemvume kuJoão Browser.</translation>
<translation id="5214761769821670245">Setha iJoão Browser njengokuzenzakalelayo bese uyiphina ku-taskbar</translation>
<translation id="1294697217796985566">Yenza i-João Browser isheshe</translation>
<translation id="1278345486417353853"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - João Browser Canary</translation>
<translation id="7803986347287457849">Kwenze kube nzima kubantu abanokufinyelela kuthrafikhi yakho ye-inthanethi ukuze babone ukuthi imaphi amasayithi owavakashelayo. I-Chromium isebenzisa ukuxhuma okuvikelekile ukuze ibheke ikheli lasesizindeni se-inthanethi lesayithi ku-DNS (Isistimu Yokwetha Isizinda).</translation>
<translation id="7810005234485217901">Ungaphina Usesho Lomfanekiso ukuze lufinyeleleke kalula</translation>
<translation id="489728561211958943">Iphrofayela ye-João Browser enale akhawunti isikhona akakade kule divayisi</translation>
<translation id="7845233973568007926">Siyabonga ngokufaka. Kufanele uqalise kabusha ikhompyutha yakho ngaphambi kokusebenzisa i-<ph name="BUNDLE_NAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="5294768452950207882">Injini yakho yokusesha ishintshwe ngaphandle kweJoão Browser. Ukuze ikuvikele, iJoão Browser iyisetha kabusha ibuyele kokuzenzakalelayo kwayo kwasekuqaleni. <ph name="LEARN_MORE_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="3244974069468656925">Yenza iJoão Browser ngokwesifiso sakho ukuze uyinikeze ukubukeka okusha</translation>
<translation id="7859018312476869945">Uma uthayipha ibha yekheli noma ibhokisi losesho, i-Chromium ithumela lokho okuthayiphayo kunjini yakho yosesho yokuzenzakalelayo ukuze uthole iziphakamiso ezingcono. Lokhu kuvaliwe ku-Incognito.</translation>
<translation id="6517519572778941051">I-João Browser ayikwazanga ukubuyekezela kwinguqulo yakamuva, ngakho-ke uyalahlekelwa kuzici ezintsha nokulungiswa kokuphepha.</translation>
<translation id="7872446069773932638">Iyadawuniloda... kusele imizuzwana engu-<ph name="SECONDS" /></translation>
<translation id="7873537467422636035">Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />sula idatha yeChromium ku-akhawunti yakho<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
