<translation id="7934340546140346950">IChromium ithuthukisa ukuxhuma okungavikelekile ku-HTTPS ngokuzenzekelayo lapho kungenzeka</translation>
<translation id="3755057387338907970">Ubukade ungene ngemvume ku-João Browser njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" />. Sicela usebenzise i-akhawunti efanayo ukuze uphinde ungene ngemvume futhi.</translation>
<translation id="929903348843569380">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usevele ungene ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuJoão Browser kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzothola namabhukhimakhi wakho nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi wakho.</translation>
<translation id="7975919845073681630">Lokhu ukufakwa kwesibili kwe-Chromium, futhi akukwazi ukwenziwa isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="8905411496853397218">Izandiso, ama-app, namatimu asuka emithonjeni engaziwa angalimaza idivayisi yakho. I-João Browser incoma ukuzifaka kuphela zisuka ku-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /></translation>
