<translation id="8132864687089402359">I-João Browser ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivelaphi, futhi kungenzeka ukuthi asiphephile. Sisuse ku-João Browser ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="7600652022483599804">Uma isithombe singanayo incazelo ephelele, i-João Browser izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google. Ungavala lokhu kuzilungiselelo noma kunini.</translation>
