<translation id="8954225380790220359">Ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi akho kanye nokwengeziwe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuJoão Browser. Le phasiwedi izolondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho ngemva kokungena ngemvume.</translation>
