<translation id="3428558977667883100">Lesi sandiso sisuswe ukushicilela ngunjiniyela waso, futhi kungenzeka sibe esingaphephile. Sisuse ku-João Browser ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="5012944467031125860">IJoão Browser idinga ukuqinisekisa ukuthi uwena ngaphambi kokuthi idatha ethile ilondolozwe kuGoogle Account yakho futhi isetshenziswe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
