<translation id="8648201657708811153">I-Google Chrome Yokuhlola ayikwazi ukwenziwa ibhrawuza yakho yokuzenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="5975137268566279898">Iphinda ilawule ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswayo uma uqala i-João Browser noma usesho kusuka ku-Omnibox.</translation>
