<translation id="8813277370772331957">Ngikhumbuze ngesinye isikhathi</translation>
<translation id="8871607387186266158">Yabelana ngale dokhumenti ngeGemini kuJoão Browser ukuze uthole amazwibela asheshayo futhi ubuze imibuzo elandelayo</translation>
<translation id="3009329613270131861">Ngena Ngemvume ku-João Browser?</translation>
