<translation id="8826492472752484139">Chofoza okluthi “Isiphathi Sephasiwedi”</translation>
<translation id="8833697763442816810">Isistimu ye-ChromiumOS</translation>
<translation id="8852026904190808918">Lolu limi lusetshenziselwa ukubonisa amamenyu, amasethingi, izexwayiso, nomunye umbhalo kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="8862326446509486874">Awunawo amalungelo afanele wokufakwa okukuleveli yesistimu. Zama ukuqalisa isifaki futhi njengomlawuli.</translation>
<translation id="6821836710312478344">Faka Iphrofayela yeJoão Browser</translation>
<translation id="5139769635207740615">IChromiumOS ayikwazanga ukulondoloza idatha yeJoão Browser kuGoogle Account yakho ngenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="6814613825007700341">Inhlangano yakho ifuna ungene ngemvume kuJoão Browser</translation>
<translation id="1009831347869773172">I-João Browser izama ukubonisa amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="690637523240192979">IJoão Browser ayiseyona ibhrawuza yakho evuleka ngokuzenzekela. Yenza iJoão Browser ibe yibhrawuza evuleka ngokuzenzekela?</translation>
<translation id="225046375773654931">Ayikwazi ukubuyekeza i-João Browser</translation>
<translation id="8944232836376404813">Lesi senzo sizokwenza lokhu:
          <ph name="LINE_BREAKS" />
            • Setha kabusha ikhasi lakho lokuqalisa, ikhasi lethebhu entsha, injini yokusesha namathebhu aphiniwe
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Vala izandiso
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Sula amakhukhi nenye idatha yesikhashana yesayithi
            <ph name="LINE_BREAKS" />
            Amabhukhimakhi, umlando, namaphasiwedi alondoloziwe ngeke aze athinteke.</translation>
<translation id="4349474976990059197">Ilogo ye-João Browser Enterprise</translation>
<translation id="3227699293368317033">Yenza iGoogle iphephe usendleleni nge-app yeJoão Browser ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho</translation>
<translation id="6527164294507620103">Ayikwazi ukuqala iJoão Browser ngoba kukhona okungahambanga kahle lapho uvula iphrofayela yakho. Zama ukuqala kabusha iJoão Browser.</translation>
<translation id="6741767563284518125">Phatha amaphrofayela e-João Browser</translation>
<translation id="3101491883380219087">Sebenzisa ikhibhodi yakho ukuze ufune phakathi kweGemini kuJoão Browser nethebhu yakho evuliwe.</translation>
<translation id="9018218886431812662">Ukufaka kuqedile</translation>
<translation id="3370247132646333337">Ukuze senze i-João Browser iphephe, sikhubaza isandiso esilandelayo esingafakiwe kuhlu lwe-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /> futhi kungenzeka singezwe ngaphandle kolwazi lakho.</translation>
<translation id="1940116386572548863">Ngena ngemvume ku-João Browser</translation>
<translation id="8381652653666868014">I-João Browser ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba ifayela lengobo yomlando lihlanganisa namanye amafayela angase afihle uhlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha</translation>
<translation id="8374335201144490555">Gcina amaphasiwedi akho, amabhukhimakhi, nomlando kuvunyelaniswe ngokuphelele kuwo wonke amadivayisi. Finyelela kalula izakhi ozaziyo nozithandayo ngokubuyekeza ibhrawuza yakho evuleka ngokuzenzakalelayo ibe yiJoão Browser. IJoão Browser izophinwa kutaskbar yakho ukuze ifinyeleleke ngokushesha.</translation>
<translation id="6176486087616698123">Sebenzisa amathuluzi e-AI ahamba phambili eGoogle nge-app yeJoão Browser efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="9062666675513499497">Ngena ngemvume ku-Chromium uma ungena ngemvume kwamanye amasevisi e-Google</translation>
<translation id="724802823738504651">I-João Browser ivalwe ngokuzenzekelayo</translation>
<translation id="2689333215784698609">I-João Browser ayikho kudethi</translation>
<translation id="8049510467237146160">{0,plural, =1{I-João Browser izoqalisa kabusha phakathi kwehora}one{I-João Browser izoqalisa kabusha emahoreni angu-#}other{I-João Browser izoqalisa kabusha emahoreni angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="9106236359747881194">Khetha umbhalo ozowusesha</translation>
<translation id="8558551666630075184">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-João Browser, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 8.1.</translation>
